browser-state*.json
crawler-debug*.json
crawler-error*.png
login-submit-error*.png
einvoice_ledger/docs/screenshots/discounts.png
einvoice_ledger/docs/screenshots/quality.png

# Frontend dependencies, builds and reports
**/frontend/node_modules/
**/frontend/dist/
**/frontend/test-results/
